          "body": "Former Munster captain Peter O’Mahony has revealed that Rassie Erasmus’ 2017 exit to join SA Rugby left him deeply disappointed at the time. O’Mahony, writing in his book All In, explained that he felt the team was finally gaining necessary direction under the South African’s guidance. While the flanker acknowledged the ruthless nature of professional sport and admitted he would likely have made the same choice himself, he conceded that the loss of Erasmus was a difficult moment for the squad."
